From: build <build@local>
Subject: [PATCH 0019] carry_costs: three gates the engine does not have

PHASE 1.3. Applies on top of 0018.

CarryEngine opens on ONE condition: the last funding print cleared
MIN_ENTRY_FUNDING_BPS. That is a reflex, not a decision. It does not know what
the money costs, what the basis will take back, or whether one print represents
the next eight hours.

0018 measured what that costs:
    borrow                    57% of gross income
    mean entry basis          +6 bps
    mean exit basis           +29 bps    <- opened narrow, closed wide
    losing trades             15 of 20

GATE 1 - BASIS
Short perp + long spot earns the basis it SHEDS between entry and exit. Funding
is rich PRECISELY when the perp trades above spot, so the signal that says
"open" and the condition that says "the basis will cost you" are the same
condition, and nothing in the engine separates them. The gate refuses when entry
basis exceeds the NET edge over the assumed hold - net, not gross, because
paying basis out of money already spoken for by borrow and fees is how a
positive-carry trade closes negative.

GATE 2 - COST OF CAPITAL
A book that opens on funding alone compares its revenue to zero. Refuses when
expected carry does not clear borrow plus the amortised round trip.

GATE 3 - EWMA, NOT THE LAST PRINT
Three-print EWMA, alpha 0.5. Below three prints it returns None and the call
site REFUSES: too little history to know the rate is not an invitation to
assume zero or reuse the last print.

THE NUMBER THAT DECIDES THE STRATEGY
ASSUMED_HOLD_DAYS is derived, not chosen. 0018 ran 20 trades over 1,453 days at
94.8% exposure = ~69 day mean hold. Set to 30, well under it, because a gate
that assumes a LONG hold to justify an entry is arguing for its own conclusion.

The sensitivity is not academic:
    hold  7 days -> round trip 4.43 bps/day vs 1.80 bps/day carry at threshold
                    THE TRADE CANNOT PAY FOR ITS OWN ENTRY
    hold 30 days -> round trip 1.03 bps/day
This one number decides whether this is a carry book or a fee generator. Any
change must be justified against a MEASURED hold, never tuned until an entry
passes.

VERIFIED, the case named in the spec:
    funding +0.6 bps, basis +30 bps -> REFUSED (CARRY_BELOW_COST_OF_CAPITAL)
      carry/day 1.80  borrow/day 1.37  round-trip/day 1.03  net -0.60

Each gate fires independently:
